# Epson Perfection V39 II (04b8:013f) -- restrict access to the seat owner.
#
# epsonscan2 ships its own rule that sets MODE="0666" for esci devices, which
# makes the scanner world-writable to every local process. This sorts before
# it and hands the device to whoever is actually logged in at the seat
# instead, which is what uaccess is for.
#
# This rule is about PERMISSIONS only. The firmware upload is epsonscan2's
# rule (60-epsonscan2.rules), which tags the device with
# ENV{firmware_file}="esfw0282.bin" on connect.
ATTRS{idVendor}=="04b8", ATTRS{idProduct}=="013f", MODE="0664", TAG+="uaccess"
